#. <CLT 4>答えが見えない…時間だけが過ぎていく…
#. このままじゃ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have the answer... Time is running out! If I\n"
"don't do something...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おやおや…もう議論は打ち止めかな？
msgctxt "0002 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Uh-oh! Have we already come to the end of the debate?"
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろ殺人の謎…この学園の謎…
#. 解けなかったみたいだね…
msgctxt "0003 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Well, it would seem you weren't unable to uncover the\n"
"mystery of this school, or Mukuro's death..."
msgstr ""

#. あれ？　ということは…
msgctxt "0004 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "You know what that means!"
msgstr ""

#. みんな仲良く“おしおき”タイムだね！
#. うぷぷぷぷぷ…！
msgctxt "0005 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "It's everyone's favorite PUNISHMENT TIME! Puhuhuhuhu!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボク達は…ここで終わってしまうのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is this really it for us? Is it all over?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>答えが見えない…時間だけが過ぎていく…
#. このままじゃ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have the answer... Time is running out! If I\n"
"don't do something...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おや？　どうやら議論は打ち止めのようだね？
msgctxt "0008 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Huh? Has the debate come to a close already?"
msgstr ""

#. この展開に絶望しましたか？　したんですね？
#. そうです…そうに決まってますよね…
msgctxt "0009 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Has this development brought you splendid despair? It\n"
"did, didn't it? Of course it did!"
msgstr ""

#. つまりは希望の負け…
#. 私様の絶望的な勝利ってことよ！
msgctxt "0010 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"You're not utterly hopeless, and my victory is\n"
"desperately complete!"
msgstr ""

#. あれぇ？　絶望しちゃったって事は…
msgctxt "0011 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"And with despair in your hearts, you know what time it\n"
"is..."
msgstr ""

#. ひゃはははははは！　行ってみるかぁ！？
msgctxt "0012 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Hyaaahahahaha! Are you ready?"
msgstr ""

#. “おしおき”ターイム！　うぷぷぷぷぷ…！
msgctxt "0013 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "It's PUNISHMENT TIME! Puhuhuhuhu!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボク達は…ここで終わってしまうのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is this really it for us? Is it all over?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0015 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. ここで諦めたりしないぞッ！
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I can't give up now!"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0017 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>リトライ<CLT><CLT 23>なさいますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Whaddya say? Wanna <CLT><CLT 3>give it another shot<CLT><CLT 23>?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
